{"code":"109070","name":"주성코퍼레이션","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"해운사","sector_desc":"컨테이너·벌크·유조선 운송. 운임 지수에 실적이 크게 흔들리는 대표적 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 2009년 주식회사 이엔페이퍼로부터 분할 설립되었으며, 4개의 비상장 계열회사를 보유하고 있음. 2021년 알에프윈도우 흡수합병으로 사업 다변화를 추진하였고, 2017년 위니테크놀러지 합병으로 Optical 부품 제조 및 공급 사업을 본격화함. 통신네트워크, 커스터머, 물류사업을 영위하며 ICS/RF 중계기, 5G 안테나 공용기, 광통신 솔루션, 차량용 블랙박스, 윈도우 필름 등을 개발·생산하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":6110.0,"open":6170.0,"high":6280.0,"low":5920.0,"volume":16321,"amount":99721310.0,"ret_1d":1.6639,"gap":2.6622,"range_pct":5.892,"ret_5":-2.8617,"ret_20":-21.1613,"ret_60":-10.0809,"ret_120":-30.0515,"ret_250":13.3581,"ma20":6893.5,"ma60":7375.5,"ma120":7636.9167,"ma200":6637.6,"close_vs_ma200":-7.9487,"close_vs_ma60":-17.1582,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-34.7859,"r2_60":0.0995,"slope_120":-30.0102,"r2_120":0.2547,"slope_250":116.9704,"r2_250":0.5559,"high52":14250.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":42.8772,"dd_52w":-57.1228,"mdd_1y":-51.7597,"atr14_pct":9.2822,"vol_ann_60":55.3454,"vol_avg20":21469.25,"vol_ratio20":0.7602,"vr5":0.5251,"vr20":0.1054,"amount_avg5":101099054.0,"amount_avg20":147229406.5,"amount_avg60":229601664.4167,"obv_chg20":-32.4771,"turnover_20":3.4215,"pv_eff_20":-6.1848,"rsi14":34.9375,"frgn_net_5":-4010.0,"inst_net_5":7.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.032,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0001,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0319,"frgn_net_20":-14977.0,"inst_net_20":8.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1193,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0001,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1193,"frgn_net_60":-30041.0,"inst_net_60":-499.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2394,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.004,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.2434,"frgn_net_120":22792.0,"inst_net_120":261.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.1816,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0021,"smart_net_120_pct":0.1837,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.73,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-3.0,"op_margin_q":-1.2346,"op_qoq":0.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-137.5,"rev_yoy":16.2679,"op_trend_4q":-56.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.22,"debt_ratio":51.04,"per":26.68,"pbr":2.1,